          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reach {{COACH_NAME}} for habit-based wellness coaching in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Learn about programs, grab a free guide, or book a call.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0b0b0c; --card:#0f1720; --muted:#9aa4b2; --accent:#ffd166; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\\n      --max-width:1100px; --radius:12px; --gap:28px; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#040406 0%,#071021 60%);color:#eef6ff;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;-moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale}\\n    .container{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:48px auto;padding:36px;}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:20px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.4px}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-size:15px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:36px;align-items:start;margin-top:34px}\\n    .hero-left{padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6)}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.8px;font-size:13px}\\n    h2{font-size:34px;margin:14px 0 6px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#081018;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\\n    .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    form label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    form input, form select, form textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:var(--glass);color:#fff;margin-top:8px}\\n    form textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:14px}\\n    footer{margin-top:42px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .pill{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .case{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}\\n    .avatar{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0f1720,#071021);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    .faq dd{color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 12px}\\n    .pattern{opacity:0.06;position:absolute;right:0;top:60px;width:360px}\\n    @media (max-width:960px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .pattern{display:none}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" alt=\\\"logo\\\" width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\"/>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Invest</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Praise</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-left card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Let's make small changes that compound</div>\\n        <h2>Talk with {{COACH_NAME}} — practical guidance for sustainable wellbeing</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I help busy adults build daily systems—habits, rhythms, and decision rules—that reduce friction and increase energy without fads or medical promises.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Schedule a discovery chat</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Quick contact</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px\\\">Prefer email or phone? Reach us directly.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n            <div>Phone: <strong style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-left:6px\\\">{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"border-left:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding-left:10px\\\">Email: <strong style=\\\"color:#fff;margin-left:6px\\\">{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Lead magnet</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px\\\">Get the 7-day Habit Reset — a concise workbook to audit one habit in a week. Enter your message below and note \\\"WORKBOOK\\\" to receive the PDF.</p>\\n        </section>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <form action=\\\"/submit\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Optional\\\">\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"interest\\\">I'm interested in</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n            <option>Foundations Path — 12-week habit architecture</option>\\n            <option>Momentum Cohort — group accountability + workshops</option>\\n            <option>Renewal Intensive — 1:1 deep-dive reset</option>\\n            <option>Just curious — free guide or discovery call</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Tell me what's happening</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Share goals, constraints, or preferred times. (Note 'WORKBOOK' for the free guide)\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n            <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:10px\\\">We respect your privacy. No medical advice is provided; coaching supports behavior and habit change.</p>\\n        </form>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      <img src=\\\"assets/img/pattern.svg\\\" alt=\\\"decor\\\" class=\\\"pattern\\\"/>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:36px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Common myths I bust with clients</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">You must overhaul everything at once to change.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">Truth:</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Small, scheduled experiments deliver clearer learning and lasting change.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Motivation is the main driver of success.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">Truth:</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Designing context and decision rules reduces reliance on motivation.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <strong>Myth:</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Wellness requires expensive products or detoxes.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">Truth:</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Consistent micro-habits produce measurable improvements without gimmicks.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:34px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Core frameworks I teach</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Decision Rules</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Clear if/then strategies that reduce daily friction and protect momentum.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Micro-Compounds</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Small actions repeated with structure to build durable capacity.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Energy Mapping</strong>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Align tasks to natural rhythms to keep habits sustainable.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:34px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Representative outcomes</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Client A — executive</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Implemented a 10-minute morning routine; reduced decision fatigue and improved consistent planning.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Client B — parent</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Built a simple sleep buffer and task batching system, gaining 4+ hours of weekend time.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:260px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"avatar\\\"><img src=\\\"assets/img/avatar.svg\\\" width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" alt=\\\"\\\"></div>\\n            <div>\\n              <strong>Client C — creative</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Used constraints and a weekly review to finish a long-delayed project without burnout.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:34px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Questions people often ask</h3>\\n      <dl class=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <dt>How do sessions work?</dt>\\n        <dd>I use brief assessments, collaborative goal design, and time-bound experiments. Each session produces concrete next steps you can test between meetings.</dd>\\n\\n        <dt>Do you provide meal plans or medical advice?</dt>\\n        <dd>No. Coaching focuses on behavior design, habit systems, and practical routines. For medical, consult a licensed clinician.</dd>\\n\\n        <dt>What if I need more accountability?</dt>\\n        <dd>Options include weekly check-ins, the Momentum Cohort for group support, or daily habit tracking templates we customize together.</dd>\\n\\n        <dt>How do I know which program fits?</dt>\\n        <dd>Use the contact form, select an interest, and we’ll recommend a path based on your timeline, budget, and capacity.</dd>\\n      </dl>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:34px;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,209,102,0.06), transparent)\\\">\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px;color:#081018\\\">Ready to start a steady change?</h3>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:0;color:#10202a\\\">Book a 20-minute discovery call to clarify one goal and the next steps you can test this week.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book discovery — 20 min</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"ghost\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">See pathways</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div>&copy; {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Need immediate help? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Project: {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Wellness Coach Site (aura_editorial)\\n\\nOverview:\\nThis repository contains a small editorial website template tailored for a wellness coach. The design uses a bold editorial aesthetic (aura_editorial) with high-contrast palettes and a strong typographic scale. It emphasizes outcomes, practical habit systems, and non-medical coaching philosophy.\\n\\nFiles in this chunk:\\n- contact.html — Contact and lead-capture page with hero, myth_vs_truth, pillars, case_studies, faq, and CTA sections.\\n\\nOther pages expected in the full bundle (must exist at root):\\n- index.html\\n- about.html\\n- services.html\\n- programs.html\\n- pricing.html\\n- testimonials.html\\n- book.html\\n- contact.html (this file)\\n\\nLocal assets (must exist in assets/img/):\\n- hero.svg  (unique SVG for hero art)\\n- avatar.svg  (unique avatar / logo mark)\\n- pattern.svg (unique decorative pattern)\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — your practice or brand name\\n- {{TAGLINE}} — short strapline\\n- {{PHONE}} — primary phone number (include country code as needed)\\n- {{EMAIL}} — primary contact email\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — main call-to-action text (e.g., \\\"Work with me\\\")\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — href for primary CTA (e.g., \\\"book.html\\\")\\n- {{COACH_NAME}} — coach's full name\\n- {{CREDENTIALS}} — credentials string (e.g., \\\"MSc, PCC\\\")\\n- {{CITY}} and {{STATE}} — locality for footer and contextual mentions\\n\\nHow to use:\\n1. Replace placeholders with site-specific values (basic find-and-replace across files).\\n2. Ensure the assets listed above are present in assets/img/ and are unique SVGs per template rules.\\n3. Open index.html in a browser to preview locally. No build step is required — files are static HTML/CSS.\\n\\nNotes & guidelines for content:\\n- Focus copy on habit systems, frameworks, and measurable outcomes. Avoid medical claims.\\n- Keep CTAs clear and specific (book, download workbook, schedule discovery call).\\n- The contact form in contact.html posts to /submit; replace with your form handling endpoint or integrate with a serverless function.\\n\\nAccessibility & performance:\\n- All images are local SVGs; optimize SVGs for size and accessibility (include meaningful <title> or role attributes if needed).\\n- The layout uses simple responsive CSS without external fonts or scripts.\\n\\nDesign customization:\\n- To dial down the editorial contrast, adjust CSS variables at the top of contact.html (e.g., --bg, --card, --accent).\\n- For a lighter aesthetic, change background gradients and card colors.\\n\\nSupport:\\nIf you need customization for a different layoutFamily (clinic_modern, earthy_warm, bold_playful, zen_minimal, lux_gallery) or to wire up a real booking backend, provide the desired scope and I can produce updated templates and integration snippets.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
